      ],
      "en": "By your wisdom and by your understanding you have gotten yourself riches, and have gotten gold and silver into your treasuries.",
      "ko": "네 지혜와 총명으로 재물을 얻었으며 금, 은을 곳간에 저축하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "f61aba8c79242b79e6aef80c73b64b8ef6b978fa90d5eb857c8389f939109573",
      "translation_text_hash": "c3df164f65cf086ba7c5222da8bdac9ee35e34d242c831d1bcfdd20c71687ef3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네 지혜와 총명으로 재물을 얻었으며 금, 은을 곳간에 저축하였으며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c3df164f65cf086ba7c5222da8bdac9ee35e34d242c831d1bcfdd20c71687ef3"
      ]
