          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 28,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "By your great wisdom and by your trading you have increased your riches, and your heart is lifted up because of your riches—”",
      "ko": "네 큰 지혜와 장사함으로 재물을 더하고 그 재물로 인하여 네 마음이 교만하였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "a94e7b564298723f45788d32b37a107a9462bfe72d69d8657f19d9c55bc0200f",
      "translation_text_hash": "567b9e3813c01315da60f4499d75734478bf0bab821c833172dc0bc33a65f0f3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
