      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 28,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "You were perfect in your ways from the day that you were created, until unrighteousness was found in you.",
      "ko": "네가 지음을 받던 날로부터 네 모든 길에 완전하더니 마침내 불의가 드러났도다",
      "source_text_hash": "e539c32a95bffe14ce58916577276e06e3924528a834b7509ba1f82cbdc42b7a",
      "translation_text_hash": "528a2ed99e69e87bdc5a61a9a2eb57baa7bf4c66c9ce95c1003152fa5e78c988",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네가 지음을 받던 날로부터 네 모든 길에 완전하더니 마침내 불의가 드러났도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "528a2ed99e69e87bdc5a61a9a2eb57baa7bf4c66c9ce95c1003152fa5e78c988"
      ]
